  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Partnership for Peace: Better HE for Resilient Societies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve quality and gender equality of HE at the partner institutions, through academic research exchange ( North-South and South-South) for students and staff, skills developmet workshops, joint thematic and methodologic PhD courses and providing space for new cooperative research on Peace and Conflict, and Human Rights law, raising awarenes of gender roles and adressing regional context (Africa, Latin America and Middle East) and the broader international research frontier.</narrative>
  </description>
